{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BLI API.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BLI API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender bli api blender bli api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BLI API.md","fileName":"Blender BLI API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender BLI API","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Library and Kernel Internals]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender blenlib Module","Blender Unit Testing with Google Test","Blender API Documentation with Doxygen","Blender BLI Stack","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BLI API.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BLI API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender bli api blender bli api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender BLI API.md","fileName":"Blender BLI API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender BLI API","heading":"Blender BLI API","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The BLI API is the public function and type interface of the [[Blender blenlib Module]]. Its headers expose generic utilities for containers, strings, math, files, paths, geometry, assertions, hashing, threading, and other common tasks, while lower-level helpers remain inside the module.\n\nMany BLI facilities are macros or inline definitions rather than separately compiled functions. [[Blender Unit Testing with Google Test]] and [[Blender API Documentation with Doxygen]] provide complementary ways to learn the large interface, while [[Blender BLI Stack]] illustrates one concrete data-structure API.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender blenlib Module","Blender Unit Testing with Google Test","Blender API Documentation with Do